  "notes": "## 1.0.0-alpha.2 - 2026-08-05\n\n### Features\n\n- Keep content type and tag filters visible in the quick panel while preserving the selected filters (#1496)\n- Show whether devices in a space are still connecting, need an update, or cannot finish connecting (#1484)\n- Show device removal progress and provide a recovery option when another device is permanently unavailable (#1504)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Let users keep encrypted history that cannot be read when switching spaces and clearly report what was preserved (#1497)\n- Make invitation code fields easier to distinguish and use across setup and space switching (#1506)\n- Remove the stray blurred decoration from the corners of the unlock screen (#1503)\n- Explain that a device waiting for readmission needs UniClipboard updated (#1483)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.0.0-alpha.2 - 2026-08-05\n\n### Features\n\n- 快捷面板会持续显示内容类型和标签筛选器，并保留已选筛选条件 (#1496)\n- 显示空间内设备是仍在连接、需要更新，还是暂时无法完成连接 (#1484)\n- 显示设备移除进度，并在其他设备永久不可用时提供恢复选项 (#1504)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 切换空间时可保留无法读取的加密历史，并明确显示保留的记录数量 (#1497)\n- 优化设置和切换空间时的邀请码输入框，使各字符更易区分和输入 (#1506)\n- 移除解锁界面角落中多余的模糊装饰 (#1503)\n- 明确提示等待重新准入的设备需要更新 UniClipboard (#1483)",
